msgstr " Reloading configuration process…"

msgid " 磁盘已提交，请重启管理窗口以重新加载账号；旧账号编辑已停用。"
msgstr ""
" Changes are committed to disk. Restart management to reload accounts; old "
"account editing is disabled."

msgid " 配置进程已重新加载。"
msgstr " Configuration process reloaded."

msgid "任务注册已更新到磁盘，配置进程未应用；运行中保留旧注册表。"
msgstr ""
" Task registration saved to disk but not applied by configuration; running "
"workers retain the old registry."

msgid "修改提示已复制，可粘贴到聊天工具并补充需求。"
msgstr ""
" Modification prompt copied. Paste it into your chat tool and add your "
"requirements."

msgid "删除整个脚本包的任务注册？配置和历史源码保留。"
msgstr ""
" Delete all task registrations in this bundle? Configuration and historical "
"source are retained."

msgid "删除此角色自定义代码并恢复内置模式？"
msgstr " Delete this character's custom code and restore built-in mode?"

msgid "安全模式：请建立首账号、导入配置包或查看完整性检查。\n"
msgstr ""
"Safe mode: create your first account, import a bundle, or review the "
"integrity check.\n"

msgid "导入会执行可信 Python 验证代码。相同脚本包标识会整组更新；原配置和历史源码保留。"
msgstr ""
"Import executes trusted Python validation code. Matching bundle IDs update "
"the entire bundle; existing configuration and source history are retained."

msgid "导入包成员不能单独删除，请使用删除脚本包。"
msgstr ""
"Imported bundle members cannot be deleted individually. Use Delete script "
"bundle."

msgid "导入包成员为只读；通过整组重导入更新代码和素材。"
msgstr ""
"Imported bundle members are read only. Reimport the entire bundle to update "
"code and assets."

msgid "当前为源码工作目录，不能在管理窗口替换游戏包；请使用已安装且带文件清单的游戏包。"
msgstr ""
"This is a source checkout. Management cannot replace its gamepack; use an "
"installed package with a file manifest."

msgid "操作失败，输出迁移未提交："
msgstr "Operation failed; output migration was not committed: "

msgid "放弃当前未保存的修改？"
msgstr "Discard the current unsaved changes?"

msgid "放弃当前未保存的角色修改？"
msgstr "Discard the current unsaved character changes?"

msgid "新任务：保存时生成稳定ID"
msgstr "New task: a stable ID is generated on save"

msgid "旧包迁移任务：确认导出类、稳定 key 与设备能力"
msgstr ""
"Legacy bundle migration: confirm exported classes, stable keys and device "
"capabilities"

msgid "未选择执行进程；展示已保存记录。"
msgstr "No execution process selected; showing saved records."

msgid "正在编辑自定义草稿，保存后才启用。"
msgstr "Editing a custom draft; it becomes active only after saving."

msgid "此动作需要执行器连接游戏设备。"
msgstr "This action requires an execution owner connected to a game device."

msgid "此页迁移输出资料，并保留原文件。账号、配置、用户脚本和数据根不迁移。迁移前停止本窗口配置进程；其他所有者仍占用数据时会明确失败。"
msgstr ""
"This page migrates output data and retains originals. Accounts, "
"configuration, user scripts and the data root stay in place. The "
"configuration process stops first; other active data owners block migration."

msgid "每次导出一个完整脚本包，或一组独立任务。"
msgstr "Export one complete bundle or a set of standalone tasks at a time."

msgid "源码已读取。修改类名仍保留这个稳定任务ID与配置。"
msgstr ""
"Source loaded. Changing the class name keeps this stable task ID and "
"configuration."

msgid "独立管理窗口：账号设置、序列与已有完成证据；读取特征码和设备动作由已启动的任务进程执行。"
msgstr ""
"Independent management: account settings, sequences and saved completion "
"evidence. Feature-code reads and device actions run in the existing task "
"process."

msgid ""
"用户任务使用 NativeBaseTask / "
"NativeTriggerTask。保存前独立验证代码；此处编辑的是可信可执行代码。保存只更新配置进程，实际运行进程需明确重载或重新启动。"
msgstr ""
"User tasks use NativeBaseTask / NativeTriggerTask. Trusted executable code "
"is validated before saving. Saving updates the configuration process; "
"running workers require explicit reload or restart."

msgid "由已启动的任务进程连续读取特征码，再确认绑定账号"
msgstr ""
"The running task process reads the feature code repeatedly; confirm before "
"binding the account."

msgid "脚本包注册与素材已更新，配置进程已应用；实际 worker 需明确重载。"
msgstr ""
"Bundle registration and assets updated in configuration; running workers "
"require explicit reload."

msgid "角色代码已保存，配置进程未应用；运行进程保留旧代码。"
msgstr ""
"Character code saved but not applied by configuration; running workers "
"retain the old code."

msgid "角色修改已保存，配置进程已应用。实际运行进程需明确重载或重启任务。"
msgstr ""
"Character changes saved and applied in configuration. Running workers "
"require explicit reload or task restart."

msgid "角色源码已读取。自定义代码须保留当前类名。"
msgstr ""
"Character source loaded. Custom code must keep the current class name."

msgid "请先选择角色并切换到自定义代码。"
msgstr "Select a character and switch to custom code first."

msgid "请选择一个脚本包，或一个以上独立任务。"
msgstr "Select one script bundle or one or more standalone tasks."

msgid "账号配置包已导出。"
msgstr "Account bundle exported."

msgid "账号配置已验证，可在任务窗口执行。"
msgstr "Account configuration verified; tasks can run from the task window."

msgid "输出目录已提交，原文件保留；数据根未迁移。配置进程将重新加载目录配置。"
msgstr ""
"Output folders committed; originals retained and data root unchanged. "
"Configuration will reload the folder settings."

msgid "输出目录已提交，收尾失败，请重新加载管理窗口："
msgstr ""
"Output folders committed, but finalization failed. Reload management: "

msgid "选择内置或自定义角色代码。保存前独立验证；运行中的共享会话需要明确重载，单次任务重启后应用。"
msgstr ""
"Choose built-in or custom character code. Code is validated before saving. "
"Shared sessions require explicit reload; one-shot tasks apply changes on "
"restart."

msgid "选择数据根所在本机磁盘上的空输出目录，先预览再迁移。"
msgstr ""
"Choose an empty output folder on the data root's local disk. Preview before "
"migration."

msgid ""
"选择角色和自定义模式，编辑或粘贴完整 Python 文件。改动行会高亮。\n"
"保存前独立验证代码；失败会保留草稿。运行中的共享会话需在启动器明确重载，单次任务需重新启动。恢复内置会删除此角色的自定义源码。"
msgstr ""
"Select a character and custom mode, then edit or paste the complete Python file. Changed lines are highlighted.\n"
"Code is validated before saving; failures retain the draft. Reload active shared sessions explicitly or restart one-shot tasks. Restoring built-in mode deletes this character's custom source."

msgid "配置进程不可用，未提交代码。"
msgstr "Configuration process unavailable; code was not committed."

msgid "配置进程不可用，未提交角色修改。"
msgstr ""
"Configuration process unavailable; character changes were not committed."

msgid "验证与保存完成；配置进程已应用。实际worker需明确重载或重新启动。"
msgstr ""
"Validation and save completed; applied in configuration. Running workers "
"require explicit reload or restart."

msgid "维护失败："
msgstr "Maintenance failed: "

msgid "输出目录已提交。"
msgstr "Output folder changes committed."

msgid "配置维护已提交。"
msgstr "Configuration maintenance committed."

msgid "配置备份已创建。"
msgstr "Configuration backup created."

msgid "配置进程启动失败。"
msgstr "Configuration process startup failed."

msgid " 配置进程未恢复："
msgstr " Configuration process did not recover: "

msgid "已有操作正在进行，或账号运行时需要重新启动；暂不能维护配置"
msgstr ""
"An operation is active or the account runtime needs restarting; "
"configuration maintenance is unavailable."

msgid "建立账号 {label} 的可信总配置？请确认手机号、昵称及所选序列。"
msgstr ""
"Create the trusted master configuration for account {label}? Confirm the "
"phone number, nickname and selected sequences."

msgid ""
"将替换当前全部账号配置：{accounts} 个账号，{sequences} 个序列，{records} 条完成记录。\n"
"导入前将保存事务备份。"
msgstr ""
"Replace all current account configurations: {accounts} accounts, {sequences} sequences and {records} completion records.\n"
"A transaction backup will be saved before import."

msgid ""
"\n"
"配置包已被外部修改；确认将明确接受这些修改。"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"The configuration bundle was modified externally; confirming explicitly accepts those changes."

msgid "目录尚未创建："
msgstr "Folder has not been created: "

msgid "无法打开目录："
msgstr "Cannot open folder: "

msgid "输出迁移预览：{files}个文件，{size:.2f} MiB。保留原文件；账号、配置和用户脚本留在数据根。"
msgstr ""
"Output migration preview: {files} files, {size:.2f} MiB. Original files are "
"preserved; accounts, configuration and user scripts stay in the data root."

msgid ""
"将输出复制并校验到：{destination}\n"
"保留原文件，更新输出目录配置，随后重新加载配置进程。"
msgstr ""
"Copy and verify output at: {destination}\n"
"Preserve original files, update output folder configuration, then reload the configuration process."

msgid "已读取{count}个用户任务；已保存版本 {saved}，配置进程版本 {applied}；运行进程需单独重载。"
msgstr ""
"Loaded {count} user tasks; saved revision {saved}, configuration process "
"revision {applied}. Reload the execution process separately."

msgid "已读取{count}个角色；已保存版本 {saved}，配置进程版本 {applied}。运行进程需单独重载。"
msgstr ""
"Loaded {count} characters; saved revision {saved}, configuration process "
"revision {applied}. Reload the execution process separately."

msgid "删除任务 {identity} 的注册？配置和历史源码保留。"
msgstr ""
"Remove the registration for task {identity}? Configuration and source "
"history will be preserved."

